290
00:15:26,640 --> 00:15:27,640
So it will definitely make money, really.

291
00:15:27,640 --> 00:15:28,360
It's very meaningful.

292
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:29,820
We're not just a simple...

293
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:35,200
It's okay.

294
00:15:35,520 --> 00:15:36,160
Let's go.

295
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:39,000
Please take another look.

296
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:39,920
We won't let you down.

297
00:15:39,920 --> 00:15:40,440
Mr. Zhang,

298
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:41,200
please just take one more look.

299
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:41,840
The structure of our script

300
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:42,880
is really excellent.

301
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:43,600
Please. I'm not interested.

302
00:15:43,600 --> 00:15:44,400
Mr. Zhang,

303
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:45,600
we will definitely make you money.

304
00:15:45,600 --> 00:15:46,480
Really. Okay, okay.

305
00:15:46,480 --> 00:15:47,120
Just give us a chance.

306
00:15:47,120 --> 00:15:47,760
I'll think about it then.

307
00:15:47,760 --> 00:15:48,600
We can communicate anytime.

308
00:15:48,600 --> 00:15:48,880
Okay, okay.

309
00:15:48,880 --> 00:15:49,400
We can really

310
00:15:49,400 --> 00:15:50,320
revise it.

311
00:15:50,400 --> 00:15:51,440
Okay, okay.

312
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:52,000
Thank you, Mr. Zhang.

313
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:52,800
Let us know if you have any questions.

314
00:15:52,800 --> 00:15:53,460
Okay, okay.

315
00:15:53,880 --> 00:15:54,600
Thank you.

316
00:15:57,240 --> 00:15:57,760
Um,

317
00:15:57,800 --> 00:15:59,080
Mr. Zhang, we'll keep in touch.

318
00:15:59,080 --> 00:16:00,400
Okay, okay. Sure, sure.

319
00:16:00,400 --> 00:16:00,720
Thank you, Mr. Zhang.

320
00:16:00,720 --> 00:16:01,720
Thank you.

321
00:16:06,400 --> 00:16:07,720
I think it should work out.

322
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:08,720
I hope we succeed.

323
00:16:20,560 --> 00:16:21,360
At that time,

324
00:16:22,240 --> 00:16:23,700
we were almost in despair.

325
00:16:24,640 --> 00:16:25,800
We never knew

326
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:30,100
it would be so hard to raise
a few hundred thousand for production.

327
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:31,320
Until one day,

328
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:34,360
Song Yanfei saw a notice
for a competition.

329
00:16:36,640 --> 00:16:38,160
You mean

330
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:39,440
the Peach Blossom Cup

331
00:16:40,680 --> 00:16:42,920
sponsored by Wending Group,

332
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,000
right?

333
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:45,080
Yes.

334
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:48,640
Although it's a small competition

335
00:16:48,640 --> 00:16:50,000
limited to our city,

336
00:16:50,200 --> 00:16:50,720
Bureau-8240514

337
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:52,520
the prize money is substantial.

338
00:16:53,040 --> 00:16:53,960
300,000 yuan

339
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:57,240
can cover most of the
dance drama's rehearsal costs.

340
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:58,800
As long as I get this money

341
00:16:58,880 --> 00:17:00,520
and we pull in some more investment later,

342
00:17:00,520 --> 00:17:02,080
it's basically a done deal.

343
00:17:02,680 --> 00:17:04,520
So you completely left Beijing

344
00:17:04,520 --> 00:17:06,240
for this competition?

345
00:17:09,280 --> 00:17:10,339
After coming back,

346
00:17:11,640 --> 00:17:13,700
I lived with my parents for a few days.

347
00:17:14,079 --> 00:17:15,119
But I felt

348
00:17:15,359 --> 00:17:17,839
it was really inconvenient
for dance practice,

349
00:17:17,839 --> 00:17:19,700
so I thought about finding a place

350
00:17:20,400 --> 00:17:21,599
to live alone.

351
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:25,480
At the time, I even discussed

352
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:27,560
living with Song Yanfei.

353
00:17:28,200 --> 00:17:29,000
Soon,

354
00:17:29,520 --> 00:17:31,200
we found this place

355
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:32,640
with a rooftop.

356
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:35,200
But who knew

357
00:17:36,560 --> 00:17:38,360
Song Yanfei kept making excuses

358
00:17:38,840 --> 00:17:40,400
about being busy with work.

359
00:17:41,320 --> 00:17:42,850
I even had to move by myself.

360
00:17:45,560 --> 00:17:48,420
Why did Song Yanfei become
the person I hate the most

361
00:17:48,440 --> 00:17:49,840
when we met again?

362
00:17:52,240 --> 00:17:53,440
Because of betrayal.

363
00:17:55,360 --> 00:17:56,560
He chose Gao Yayan

364
00:17:57,120 --> 00:17:58,400
for the dance drama.

365
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:01,200
The most ridiculous part is that

366
00:18:01,520 --> 00:18:03,980
I was the one
who introduced Gao Yayan to him.

